      "guid": "com.acidphantasm.bosseshavelegamedals",
      "name": "Bosses Have Lega Medals",
      "slug": "bosses-have-lega-medals",
      "teaser": "Bosses have a configurable chance to have Lega Medals in their pockets.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2109.png",
      "downloads": 190949,
      "favourites_count": 221,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Bosses Have Lega Medals</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-bosseshavelegamedals</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Recommended Mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2523/bosses-have-gp-coins/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bosses Have GP Coins</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1538/ref-spt-friendly-quests/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ref - SPT Friendly Quests</a></li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
